calibration error of about five percent.

27
00:01:42,656 --> 00:01:46,583
Open: how many bits a language
model really needs, whether

28
00:01:46,583 --> 00:01:50,644
training can absorb the device's
noise and drift, and how to

29
00:01:50,644 --> 00:01:54,774
