30
00:01:55,883 --> 00:01:57,647
Fourth front: theory.

31
00:01:58,027 --> 00:02:02,807
A theory of thermodynamic complexity is
missing: how much mixing time and how much

32
00:02:02,807 --> 00:02:07,295
