how it compares with digital computing.

33
00:02:07,675 --> 00:02:10,653
We know expressivity is
paid for in mixing, and

34
00:02:10,653 --> 00:02:13,566
that compilation error
accumulates with depth.

35
00:02:13,946 --> 00:02:17,726
And there is a lot of physical
headroom: a Z1 sample costs

36
00:02:17,726 --> 00:02:21,440
about thirteen femtojoules,
four and a half million times

37
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:24,502
the thermal scale k T ln
2 at room temperature.

38
