hours in twenty twenty-four,

41
00:02:36,107 --> 00:02:40,213
around 1.5 percent of world
electricity, and projected

42
00:02:40,213 --> 00:02:44,015
close to nine hundred
forty-five by twenty thirty.

43
00:02:44,395 --> 00:02:47,661
More efficient hardware
helps, but efficiency can

44
00:02:47,661 --> 00:02:50,595
