47
00:02:59,950 --> 00:03:03,706
For your final project, there
is room in four directions:

48
00:03:03,706 --> 00:03:07,791
architectures with a smaller
sparsity tax, moving the head and

49
00:03:07,791 --> 00:03:11,744
